{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["offline_access"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Append Price List Lines"},"description":"Add or overwrite up to 500 prices on a price list (id or code), as the list's lines upload does. A line is an item (id or SKU), an optional uomId (omit for the base unit), a minimumQuantity where the break starts (default 1) and a unitPrice before tax; isActive=false keeps a line but stops it pricing. A line is identified by item, unit and minimum quantity: sending one that exists overwrites its price, and re-sending the same lines changes nothing, so a large list arrives in several calls and any call can be repeated. The preview says for each line whether it is added, updated (with the old price) or unchanged. On an active list the new prices apply to orders priced from the confirm on, and every change is written to the list's change log. Archived lists are frozen. Requires an operator (unpinned) credential with Write + catalog.execute and an Admin.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"idempotencyKey":{"default":null,"description":"Caller-generated idempotency key; required with previewReceipt to commit.","type":["string","null"]},"lines":{"description":"The lines to add or overwrite, 1 to 500.","items":{"properties":{"isActive":{"description":"false keeps the line but stops it pricing. Defaults to true.","type":["boolean","null"]},"item":{"description":"The item id (GUID) or SKU.","type":["string","null"]},"minimumQuantity":{"description":"Where the break starts, in that unit; greater than 0. Defaults to 1 (the price from the first unit).","type":["number","null"]},"unitPrice":{"description":"Price per unit, before tax; 0 or more.","type":["number","null"]},"uomId":{"description":"Optional unit id (GUID, from list_uoms) the break is in; omit for the item's base unit.","type":["string","null"]}},"type":["object","null"]},"type":["array","null"]}